        {
          "blockId": "spya-x57hc8",
          "kind": "recall",
          "text": "This is the 'alliances' idea from the previous paragraph: popularity is built by getting close to other popular kids, and a common enemy does that fastest.",
          "quote": "Attacking an outsider makes them all insiders.",
